; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2391  **               2. If an activation edge has been detected this service will**
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2392  **                  return ICU_ACTIVE.                                       **
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2393  **               3. Once the service has returned the status ICU_ACTIVE the  **
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2394  **                  stored status will be set to ICU_IDLE until the next     **
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2395  **                  edge is detected.                                        **
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2396  **               4. If no  edge has been detected this service will          **
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2397  **                  return ICU_IDLE.                                         **
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2398  **               5. If development error detection is enabled and an error is**
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2399  **                  detected the service returns ICU_IDLE.                   **
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2400  **               6. Signal edge detection channels                           **
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2401  **                  channels status is changed here.                         **
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2402  **               7. For a signal measurement channel only the status         **
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2403  **                  is returned and its not put to IDLE. A successful read   **
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2404  **                  of Icu_17_GtmCcu6_GetTimeElapsed or                      **
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2405  **                  Icu_17_GtmCcu6_GetDutyCycleValues                        **
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2406  **                  will set the state to ICU_IDLE                           **
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2407  **                                                                           **
; ..\_03_MCAL\Src\Icu\src\Icu_17_GtmCcu6.c	  2408  *****************************************************************************/
